(Q7) Which command is used to check how long the system has been running? 
             The  uptime command shows how long the system has been running since the last boot/restart.
Example Code:
 bash
# More detailed uptime info
cat /proc/uptime

# Human-readable uptime only
uptime -p
# Output: up 5 days, 3 hours, 42 minutes

# Since when system is running
uptime -s
# Output: 2025-09-16 10:48:25
